1
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,159
Mail delivery.

2
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,480
Came three times, but nobody was home.

3
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,400
Oh, you're home.

4
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,879
Lane 75, Number Two.

5
00:01:58,079 --> 00:02:00,239
I came three times, and nobody was home.

6
00:02:00,799 --> 00:02:03,200
Had to catch you right as my shift began.

7
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,400
I haven't seen you around before.

8
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:09,360
Did you just move in?

9
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,080
Anything fragile in here?

10
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,080
Open it and check.

11
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,000
Once you sign, we take no responsibility.

12
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,840
What a mute.

13
00:02:23,039 --> 00:02:24,439
Your rear brake pads are almost worn out.

14
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,319
Remember to change them.

15
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:27,960
Also, if you were quicker and came early,

16
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,319
you wouldn't have wasted three trips.

17
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,159
Such a mute,

18
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,599
but he sure has a nasty mouth.

19
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:54,360
Everyone, fall in and face me.

20
00:02:55,479 --> 00:02:56,800
Watch your step getting off.

21
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,360
Hurry up.

22
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,919
Keep up.

23
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:02,919
Hurry up in the back.

24
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,840
Gather at the front after getting off.

25
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:15,199
Right, dress!

26
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,599
Eyes front!

27
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:17,400
At ease!

28
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,000
Attention!

29
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,280
Right, face!

30
00:03:21,479 --> 00:03:22,759
Forward, march!

31
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,240
The new place is quite nice.

32
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,639
There are no issues.

33
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,919
You don't need to worry.

34
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,240
The things sent from home,

35
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,800
I received them this morning.

36
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,680
I'll be very busy for a while.

37
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,280
Please don't tell anyone.

38
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,000
If anyone asks,

39
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,879
just say I went traveling.

40
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:46,159
I went over everything from the start.

41
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:48,400
Meeting Jiang Zaizhen in Hong Kong, China,

42
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,639
to her landing overseas,

43
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,960
then entering the safe house,

44
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,680
and finally boarding the plane directly.

45
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,560
All along the way,

46
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:56,479
someone was tipping off Taiwan, China.

47
00:03:56,479 --> 00:03:57,560
This person

48
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,639
is among us.

49
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:03,000
Are you sure?

50
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,800
Maybe there's more than one.

51
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,560
Maybe there will be more.

52
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,560
Jiang Zaizhen

53
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,719
saw a top-secret file in Taipei herself.

54
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,120
She's very certain

55
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:14,000
that the enemy has breached our defenses.

56
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:15,159
If we don't plug the hole,

57
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:17,560
the leaks will keep coming.

58
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,800
We can talk about the future tomorrow.

59
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,839
Let's talk about yesterday first.

60
00:04:23,839 --> 00:04:24,839
Who do you think it is?

61
00:04:25,839 --> 00:04:26,560
It's hard to say.

62
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,759
Is it hard to say,

63
00:04:27,959 --> 00:04:29,040
or you just can't say?

64
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,800
Does it look like him?

65
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:33,000
What does shaking your head mean?

66
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,040
No,

67
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:34,879
I just can't be sure.

68
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:39,399
Take the leaked intel Jiang Zaizhen cited

69
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:40,279
and compile it for me.

70
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,000
I'll arrange for someone

71
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,600
to start investigating from this point.

72
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,800
Did she say anything else?

73
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:46,279
Taiwan, China will send new people soon.

74
00:04:46,279 --> 00:04:47,160
The scale is unprecedented.

75
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,480
It includes their official agents,

76
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:50,920
as well as corrupted youths from our side.

77
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:56,399
Lee Teng-hui aims to "visit the US."

78
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:57,959
If this happens,

79
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:59,079
it will be the fuse.

80
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:01,439
People on both sides will prepare for it.

81
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,480
All intelligence channels will activate.

82
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:06,839
The missiles are a highly coveted prize.

83
00:05:07,199 --> 00:05:09,399
You need to lock them down tight for me.

84
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,360
When the time comes,

85
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,399
Mawei Naval Port, the military compound,

86
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,199
Institutes 761, 762, and 766.

87
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:16,439
It's a massive game of chess.

88
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:18,160
All the pieces will start moving.

89
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,839
How big will our moves be?

90
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,319
If Taiwan, China makes a knight move,

91
00:05:25,519 --> 00:05:26,279
I'll counter with a central cannon

92
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:27,000
and put them in check.

93
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,920
Director.

94
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,879
The Jiang Zaizhen case happened suddenly.

95
00:05:31,879 --> 00:05:33,120
None of us can guarantee

96
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,040
if there are other moles among us.

97
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,240
The stakes are high.

98
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:38,319
Cross-strait military intel's success

99
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:39,439
might depend on this one move.

100
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,199
We can't afford any mistakes.

101
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:43,240
Openly create a diversion.

102
00:05:43,639 --> 00:05:44,680
Interrogate everyone,

103
00:05:44,759 --> 00:05:46,160
starting with myself.

104
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,680
Please detain me publicly,

105
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:50,680
while I secretly head to Germany

106
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:52,480
to execute our real plan.

107
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:54,879
Yes, sir.

108
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:30,079
Which way is the Aviation Power booth?

109
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:31,639
It's the one at this exhibition

110
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:34,680
featuring that outstanding project.

111
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:37,800
That booth should be in Zone A.

112
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:40,199
It's the largest booth on the corner.

113
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:41,319
Thank you very much.

114
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:42,120
You're welcome.

115
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:45,720
I found out.

116
00:06:46,199 --> 00:06:47,000
It's right over there.

117
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:47,600
Follow me.

118
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,720
Sorry.

119
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,079
It's okay.

120
00:07:04,319 --> 00:07:06,399
How do we make the missile's tail ignite

121
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,680
to fly faster, higher, and farther?

122
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:12,040
Master foreign skills to counter them.

123
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:14,519
The wider the gap, the more we must learn.

124
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:17,319
Fighting for titles at home is useless.

125
00:07:17,839 --> 00:07:19,920
If you don't open your eyes to the world,

126
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,360
it's a dead end.

127
00:07:22,839 --> 00:07:24,680
Practice is more important than theory.

128
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:28,879
Researchers can't work in a vacuum.

129
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:30,240
We need to get out and see the world.

130
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,920
You have a lot of eggs,

131
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,360
but you lack the

132
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,319
power and speed to throw them out.

133
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:37,120
Once others get ahead of you,

134
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:39,399
no matter how many eggs you have,

135
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:41,079
they'll all break in the nest.

136
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:43,399
We've been studying arm strength,

137
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:46,560
studying carts full of eggs,

138
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,800
to throw them faster and more accurately.

139
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:49,800
We were wrong.

140
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,879
Think about it.

141
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:54,480
Since we can't increase the cart's speed,

142
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:57,000
why don't we start with the fuel?

143
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,279
Use the speed of the fuel

144
00:07:58,279 --> 00:07:59,879
to make up for the speed of the cart.

145
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,079
That's it for work today.

146
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:04,079
Let's drink tonight.

147
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:05,040
We won't leave until we're drunk.

148
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:05,839
Alright!

149
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:06,560
Mainlanders...

150
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,600
are just so much trouble.

151
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:11,079
Hosting is definitely no problem.

152
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:14,199
We Ronghai people love making friends.

153
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:16,759
Wining and dining are small matters.

154
00:08:16,759 --> 00:08:18,279
I'm doing business here,

155
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:20,199
I'm not a professional tour guide, right?

156
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,560
Boss Wen.

157
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,319
I'll talk to you later.

158
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,360
Leader Cao, this way!

159
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,480
Long time no see! Long time no see!

160
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:29,319
Let me introduce him to everyone.

161
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,639
Boss Wen Zongshu.

162
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,000
A friend of Director Lei,

163
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,320
and also our fellow Ronghai native.

164
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,559
He does massive business in Europe.

165
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,480
And he's very hospitable.

166
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:38,559
The hotel and cars for our trip this time

167
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:40,720
were all arranged by Boss Wen for us.

168
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:41,919
Hello, hello, hello.

169
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:42,600
Nice to meet you. Nice to meet you.

170
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:45,120
I worried you wouldn't beat the jet lag.

171
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,240
Initially, as soon as you landed, I wanted

172
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,039
to invite you to dinner.

173
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:50,000
Right next door,

174
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,159
are some great specialty restaurants.

175
00:08:52,159 --> 00:08:52,840
Sound good?

176
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,399
This way.

177
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:54,200
Let's go, let's go.

178
00:09:01,559 --> 00:09:03,519
Where else do you want to go this time?

179
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:05,679
This time we're mainly visiting

180
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:07,000
Hamburg, Berlin, and Munich.

181
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,039
Just these three places.

182
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,320
Europe isn't actually that big.

183
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:10,080
Since you're already here,

184
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,720
why not visit other countries?

185
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:13,279
Time is too tight this time.

186
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,159
Baby!

187
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:14,799
What are you doing?!

188
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,159
What do you want?

189
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:17,759
Take your hands off!

190
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,320
Foreigners are all like that.

191
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:20,919
They're a bit more open.

192
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:21,759
Yes, very open.

193
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:23,000
And they're still not used to it.

194
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,879
Hello.

195
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,720
Let's just ignore them.

196
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,720
Let's go our own way.

197
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,240
Hey friend.

198
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,519
Hello, friend.

199
00:09:29,519 --> 00:09:30,200
Hello.

200
00:09:31,759 --> 00:09:33,639
What's going on here? What's going on?

201
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:36,960
Stop!

202
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:37,679
What's wrong?

203
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,960
Stop!

204
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:40,159
Stop right there!

205
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:46,279
Don't run!

206
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,639
Who is it?

207
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:49,679
Mr. Cao, here are your painkillers.

208
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:59,039
I didn't buy any painkillers.

209
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,559
Boss Wen sent you to deliver them, right?

210
00:11:03,919 --> 00:11:05,679
Come in, have a seat.

211
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,360
My surname is Zhu.

212
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:14,000
My given name is Yingjia.

213
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,000
I've lived in Taiwan, China a long time.

214
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,879
Serving in the ROC Ministry of Defense

215
00:11:16,879 --> 00:11:19,159
as a Military Intelligence Bureau Colonel.

216
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,399
This is not Minzhong.

217
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,799
Nor is it Taipei.

218
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,159
No one can hear us talking.

219
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,519
It's very safe.

220
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,919
I'd like ten minutes of your time

221
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,159
for a heart-to-heart talk

222
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:35,720
and to make a friend.

223
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:48,559
Lao Jia! Lao Jia!

224
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,799
Lao Jia!

225
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:02,799
Call the police.

226
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,440
Maricotre Hotel.

227
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,320
Someone's trying to rape an underage girl.

228
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:08,600
We need you here immediately.

229
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,679
Your friend was a bit too impatient.

230
00:12:13,679 --> 00:12:16,120
This girl just turned fourteen yesterday.

231
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,519
In Germany,

232
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:19,759
having sex with a minor is illegal.

233
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:23,159
Liaoping, I'm innocent!

234
00:12:27,679 --> 00:12:28,440
Beiyuan Longbei.

235
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:29,720
Dragon-Phoenix tea cakes.

236
00:12:29,879 --> 00:12:31,519
I couldn't get Song Dynasty tributes.

237
00:12:31,639 --> 00:12:33,320
I only have this modest gift,

238
00:12:33,519 --> 00:12:34,519
to show my sincerity.

239
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,159
I'm an unrefined man.

240
00:12:36,159 --> 00:12:37,679
I don't know tea, I just drink it blindly.

241
00:12:37,679 --> 00:12:41,559
Unlike you, who has the taste to be picky.

242
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:44,799
I had someone get this tea from Ronghai.

243
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,360
The leaves are plump.

244
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,480
The color is dark and glossy.

245
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:49,399
Once brewed, the aroma is lasting.

246
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:51,519
Try it while it's hot.

247
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:54,240
You even know what kind of tea I like.

248
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,720
Making friends is like courting a girl.

249
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:58,360
If I ask her out to dinner,

250
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:01,200
I'd want to know her favorite food.

251
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,799
But I prefer coffee.

252
00:13:07,159 --> 00:13:09,759
Hence the face-to-face communication.

253
00:13:10,759 --> 00:13:11,960
The more we talk,

254
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:14,440
the more we understand each other.

255
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:19,879
Out of all the experts in the delegation,

256
00:13:19,879 --> 00:13:22,000
that I'd be the one to turn traitor?

257
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,159
That's impossible.

258
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,440
You are exceptionally good at your work.

259
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,919
Truly brilliant.

260
00:13:30,919 --> 00:13:32,120
At the 761 Institute,

261
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:34,799
every major technological breakthrough

262
00:13:34,799 --> 00:13:36,919
comes from your department.

263
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:39,919
But you have a unique personality.

264
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:43,039
You'd spend three months' pay on a watch.

265
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,720
You chose not to have kids.

266
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,799
You live a carefree life.

267
00:13:45,919 --> 00:13:48,159
You never kiss up to anyone.

268
00:13:48,399 --> 00:13:51,840
Despite your work, they won't value you.

269
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,799
You have complaints and grievances.

270
00:13:55,159 --> 00:13:55,960
Unfortunately,

271
00:13:56,679 --> 00:13:58,519
they were heard by the higher-ups.

272
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:01,759
Having you lead this delegation to Europe

273
00:14:01,759 --> 00:14:05,399
was an excuse to promote someone else.

274
00:14:07,159 --> 00:14:09,320
Research units only value one achievement:

275
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,799
academic achievement.

276
00:14:11,879 --> 00:14:13,960
Promotion or not doesn't matter to me.

277
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,399
It's just a matter of face.

278
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,559
However,

279
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:21,320
your relatives haven't repaid their loans,

280
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:23,480
and your ancestral home needs renovation.

281
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,679
Financial holes must be filled eventually.

282
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,919
You usually spend a lot,

283
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,440
and you're particular about your clothes.

284
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:35,080
This welcoming gift

285
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:38,240
can help solve some practical problems.

286
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,000
Your salary will continue to be paid.

287
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,960
Four thousand US dollars a month,

288
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:47,159
just as a part-time consultant.

289
00:14:47,559 --> 00:14:48,519
It's very simple.

290
00:14:57,559 --> 00:14:59,440
If I reject your bribes,

291
00:15:00,679 --> 00:15:02,840
how will you coerce me?

292
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,759
The stakes are high.

293
00:15:06,519 --> 00:15:08,480
Of course, you need to think it over.

294
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:10,600
No rush to answer.

295
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,759
This passport

296
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,559
was recovered by the police.

297
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:22,360
Since you called the police via the hotel,

298
00:15:22,679 --> 00:15:25,120
the thief happened to be caught.

299
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,759
As for your colleague,

300
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:29,360
he was completely unaware when

301
00:15:29,679 --> 00:15:33,279
he allegedly brought a minor to the hotel.

302
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:35,440
Call the police.

303
00:15:35,919 --> 00:15:37,679
Maricotre Hotel.

304
00:15:37,919 --> 00:15:39,559
Someone's trying to rape an underage girl.

305
00:15:39,759 --> 00:15:41,200
We need you here immediately.

306
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:45,759
Liaoping, I'm innocent!

307
00:15:47,039 --> 00:15:48,320
He will also

308
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,840
be freed once his innocence is verified.

309
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:54,799
But this incident will remain on record,

310
00:15:55,639 --> 00:15:58,480
and become the focus of the delegation.

311
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,399
Therefore, our conversation

312
00:15:59,399 --> 00:16:01,000
won't be known by a third person.

313
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:03,759
Either

314
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,440
you return home normally,

315
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,440
and we'll pretend we never met.

316
00:16:09,279 --> 00:16:10,200
Or

317
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,559
you stay and wait for a new passport,

318
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,879
and we continue our deep conversation.

319
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,679
Mr. Cao, let's go.

320
00:16:57,679 --> 00:16:58,279
Okay.

321
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,680
Comrade Zhu Yingjia

322
00:17:59,039 --> 00:18:00,640
will replace Jiang Zaizhen

323
00:18:00,759 --> 00:18:03,119
as Deputy Director of the 4th Department,

324
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:05,000
taking sole charge of

325
00:18:05,519 --> 00:18:09,000
"enemy-line" dispatch and intel gathering.

326
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:13,039
I hope you will remain steadfastly loyal

327
00:18:13,519 --> 00:18:14,839
and serve the Party and State.

328
00:18:25,799 --> 00:18:27,920
Sending our core personnel to the mainland

329
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:29,799
has now become normalized.

330
00:18:29,799 --> 00:18:31,279
In the near term,

331
00:18:31,279 --> 00:18:33,759
we will further increase pace and numbers.

332
00:18:33,759 --> 00:18:35,079
As for the results,

333
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:37,400
they remain inconsistent.

334
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,079
Regarding recent developments,

335
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,079
we are all well aware of the situation.

336
00:18:41,079 --> 00:18:43,039
Deputy Director Zhu here

337
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,279
has spent years fighting the enemy,

338
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:47,319
and has extensive practical experience.

339
00:18:47,559 --> 00:18:50,039
He has prepared a sweeping reform plan.

340
00:18:50,279 --> 00:18:51,359
Deputy Director Zhu,

341
00:18:52,759 --> 00:18:53,640
please go ahead.

342
00:18:55,599 --> 00:18:57,160
Jiang Zaizhen's defection

343
00:18:57,559 --> 00:18:58,759
isn't entirely a bad thing.

344
00:18:59,119 --> 00:19:00,400
It's also an opportunity.

345
00:19:00,519 --> 00:19:03,400
Why not analyze her motives deeply?

346
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:05,200
Why not use this to drive forward

347
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:07,039
legislation and reform?

348
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:08,519
To give an example,

349
00:19:08,519 --> 00:19:10,440
if any of our compatriots,

350
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,519
regardless of their status,

351
00:19:11,519 --> 00:19:12,920
even myself included,

352
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:15,599
even if mainland State Security

353
00:19:15,599 --> 00:19:17,440
suspects or arrests them,

354
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:19,640
detains, questions, or even turns them,

355
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:21,119
if they return and are willing to talk,

356
00:19:21,119 --> 00:19:23,319
even if they are our government officials

357
00:19:23,319 --> 00:19:25,720
or our own agents sent to the mainland,

358
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,480
as long as they tell the whole truth,

359
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,599
all past actions will be forgiven,

360
00:19:28,599 --> 00:19:29,720
and their pensions guaranteed,

361
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:32,319
so that no one has any lingering worries.

362
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:33,960
Only a system like this

363
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,440
can motivate more young people

364
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:37,960
to willingly risk their lives.

365
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:00,000
Hello.

366
00:20:00,519 --> 00:20:01,319
I'm here to report for duty.

367
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:06,440
What time were you told to be here?

368
00:20:07,119 --> 00:20:08,039
Before eight.

369
00:20:09,039 --> 00:20:10,240
It's only 7:40.

370
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,039
I'm not late.

371
00:20:12,119 --> 00:20:13,200
Just wait.

372
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,440
I already rang the bell.

373
00:20:18,279 --> 00:20:19,039
By the way,

374
00:20:19,319 --> 00:20:20,079
my last name is Gong.

375
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:21,440
Gong as in "palace."

376
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,720
You can just call me Xiao Gong.

377
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:24,440
There are rules here.

378
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,640
No names allowed.

379
00:20:26,039 --> 00:20:27,039
Didn't you know?

380
00:20:29,559 --> 00:20:31,160
You're here to report for duty, right?

381
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:44,680
First of all, welcome, everyone.

382
00:20:45,079 --> 00:20:47,160
You've all been carefully selected.

383
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:49,000
Now, please introduce yourselves.

384
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,519
You there, you go first.

385
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,640
Li Huadong.

386
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,440
Born in Guangdong in 1972.

387
00:20:56,519 --> 00:20:57,839
Height: 180 centimeters.

388
00:20:57,839 --> 00:20:59,000
Stop, stop, stop.

389
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:01,759
Why don't you add your weight, blood type,

390
00:21:01,759 --> 00:21:03,799
home address, and your resume,

391
00:21:03,799 --> 00:21:04,720
attach a photo,

392
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:05,920
and publish it in the newspaper?

393
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:07,160
Weren't we to introduce ourselves?

394
00:21:07,519 --> 00:21:08,559
Not even in class.

395
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:10,079
Haven't you ever watched a spy movie?

396
00:21:10,079 --> 00:21:12,279
East and West Germany, the two Koreas,

397
00:21:12,279 --> 00:21:13,079
the US and the Soviet Union.

398
00:21:13,079 --> 00:21:14,319
Which of them didn't have spies

399
00:21:14,319 --> 00:21:15,079
in each other's ranks?

400
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,319
How can you be sure that among us here,

401
00:21:17,319 --> 00:21:18,599
there are no enemy moles?

402
00:21:18,599 --> 00:21:19,680
Maybe he is one.

403
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:20,839
Him, or him.

404
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:25,680
Lesson one, section one, point one:

405
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:27,079
Whatever people ask you,

406
00:21:27,599 --> 00:21:29,359
don't answer if it's not necessary.

407
00:21:29,359 --> 00:21:29,880
Continue.

408
00:21:30,359 --> 00:21:31,599
You can all call me Xiao Li.

409
00:21:31,599 --> 00:21:33,519
I'm 22, a police academy graduate.

410
00:21:33,519 --> 00:21:34,960
I've interned in the public security system.

411
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:35,880
With excellent grades.

412
00:21:36,039 --> 00:21:37,160
My Party membership date

413
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:38,880
is probably the earliest among my peers.

414
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:39,480
Sit down.

415
00:21:43,319 --> 00:21:44,119
You go next.

416
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:45,200
Yes, you.

417
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:48,319
You can all call me Xiao Wu.

418
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:50,160
Wu, the word 'five' with a person radical.

419
00:21:50,319 --> 00:21:52,720
Though I ranked first in the city's exam,

420
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:55,000
I feel I still have room for improvement.

421
00:21:55,119 --> 00:21:56,720
I hope to learn a lot from everyone.

422
00:21:57,519 --> 00:21:58,519
Within that humility

423
00:21:58,640 --> 00:21:59,799
lies a hint of

424
00:21:59,799 --> 00:22:00,559
pride.

425
00:22:00,559 --> 00:22:01,359
Sit down.

426
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:02,720
Reporting!

427
00:22:04,079 --> 00:22:05,400
Didn't Comrade Li Fengge inform you

428
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:06,400
that you can't be late for class?

429
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:07,680
I'm not late.

430
00:22:07,799 --> 00:22:09,079
It's not even 8:00 yet.

431
00:22:14,039 --> 00:22:14,920
You stand and listen.

432
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:15,640
There's no seat for you.

433
00:22:15,640 --> 00:22:16,480
Close the door.

434
00:22:17,759 --> 00:22:18,960
Let me go over the rules.

435
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,279
First, do not be late.

436
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:21,119
Second,

437
00:22:21,319 --> 00:22:22,799
until the training is over,

438
00:22:22,799 --> 00:22:23,880
none of you

439
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:25,160
are allowed to ask each other about

440
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:26,759
your identities and backgrounds.

441
00:22:26,759 --> 00:22:29,240
Third, according to our superiors' orders,

442
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:31,359
the teaching method this time will be reformed.

443
00:22:31,359 --> 00:22:32,759
You are all part of a pilot program.

444
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:35,559
Did I tell you to move?

445
00:22:38,599 --> 00:22:40,400
I'd distract others standing on the side.

446
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:42,200
They won't see me if I stand in the back.

447
00:22:44,839 --> 00:22:45,680
During the training period,

448
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:49,759
the bureau will randomly come pick people.

449
00:22:49,759 --> 00:22:51,559
Half your time will be out on missions,

450
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:52,480
and half your time in class.

451
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,640
Apply what you learn.

452
00:22:54,119 --> 00:22:56,039
I hope you'll adjust your attitudes.

453
00:22:56,039 --> 00:22:56,799
You must know that this

454
00:22:56,799 --> 00:22:58,839
isn't the classroom where you slacked off.

455
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:00,400
This is a classified unit,

456
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,359
a disciplined force.

457
00:23:01,759 --> 00:23:02,680
Is that clear?

458
00:23:02,759 --> 00:23:03,359
Clear!

459
00:23:18,599 --> 00:23:19,400
Director.

460
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:26,000
See for yourself.

461
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:36,720
That fast?

462
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:37,680
Not fast enough.

463
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:38,880
Then...

464
00:23:39,079 --> 00:23:41,160
Come help me with these eye drops.

465
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:45,720
The rookies lack experience.

466
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,079
Sending them over now...

467
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,880
...means a high chance of failure.

468
00:23:50,519 --> 00:23:51,960
They'd likely be going to their deaths.

469
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,440
There's no time, Old Zhu.

470
00:23:57,960 --> 00:23:58,480
Here.

471
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,519
And this side.

472
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:02,880
If this Lee...

473
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:05,519
...ever sets foot on US soil...

474
00:24:05,839 --> 00:24:08,440
...you know the cross-strait dynamic...

475
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,960
...will turn into.

476
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,480
If I were him...

477
00:24:12,319 --> 00:24:13,759
...either I wouldn't go...

478
00:24:14,039 --> 00:24:15,000
...or if I did...

479
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,880
...those extreme remarks...

480
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,279
...I'd definitely make them.

481
00:24:18,599 --> 00:24:20,160
Without making those extreme remarks...

482
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:21,519
...what's the point of going?

483
00:24:21,799 --> 00:24:22,359
Right?

484
00:24:24,359 --> 00:24:25,720
But once he does...

485
00:24:26,799 --> 00:24:28,359
...what will the CCP think?

486
00:24:29,519 --> 00:24:30,920
What moves will they make?

487
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:31,880
Have you thought about it?

488
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,319
Drills.

489
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:36,160
Live-fire drills.

490
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:38,599
Or even an accidental discharge...

491
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,079
...sparking a war.

492
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:42,279
Those tasks you're handling...

493
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:43,799
...need to be sped up too.

494
00:24:44,279 --> 00:24:46,680
Missile intel, military maps...

495
00:24:47,079 --> 00:24:47,720
Even the tiniest scraps...

496
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:48,920
...I won't turn down.

497
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:50,720
Taiwan, China...

498
00:24:50,720 --> 00:24:52,680
...must make preparations early.

499
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:55,920
Understood.

500
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:59,400
Old Zhu...

501
00:25:00,039 --> 00:25:02,279
...don't you have a lot of seeds?

502
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:04,200
Scatter them all across the mainland.

503
00:25:04,720 --> 00:25:06,000
Don't hold a single one back.

504
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:07,680
If they aren't planted in the dirt...

505
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:09,759
...how will you know which will die...

506
00:25:09,759 --> 00:25:10,599
...and which will survive?

507
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:31,079
Attention, all passengers.

508
00:25:31,240 --> 00:25:32,559
You have entered the inspection area.

509
00:25:32,839 --> 00:25:34,599
Please have your ID cards,

510
00:25:34,599 --> 00:25:36,119
passports, and related documents ready

511
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,839
for customs security checks.

512
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:40,920
Do not carry contraband or banned books.

513
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:43,240
For inquiries, visit the information desk.

514
00:25:46,799 --> 00:25:47,400
Hold on.

515
00:25:49,839 --> 00:25:50,440
Where are you headed?

516
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:52,599
Kyrgyzstan.

517
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:53,640
What was that?

518
00:25:57,240 --> 00:25:57,920
A-Zheng.

519
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:02,200
Come here. Come with me.

520
00:26:02,559 --> 00:26:03,920
Please cooperate with the inspection.

521
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,559
You in the glasses.

522
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,240
Yes, you.

523
00:26:21,279 --> 00:26:22,279
Is there a problem?

524
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:24,559
We'll find out once we check, won't we?

525
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:35,200
Where are you headed?

526
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,160
Here's my ticket.

527
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:37,920
You can see for yourself.

528
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:39,920
I'm asking you, so answer me.

529
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:42,200
Understand?

530
00:26:43,759 --> 00:26:44,279
Xiamen.

531
00:26:44,279 --> 00:26:44,920
ID card.

532
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:58,920
Where did you get this?

533
00:26:59,559 --> 00:27:00,440
Where's the old one?

534
00:27:01,279 --> 00:27:03,799
Everyone is required to get a new ID.

535
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:05,799
Aren't you replacing yours?

536
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:09,680
Bring the box over.

537
00:27:10,839 --> 00:27:12,000
Bring the box over for inspection.

538
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:12,799
Put it here?

539
00:27:17,839 --> 00:27:18,839
Open the box.

540
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,680
Be careful, will you?

541
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:46,160
Don't move.

542
00:27:46,359 --> 00:27:47,160
Don't move.

543
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:48,039
I'm checking.

544
00:27:48,039 --> 00:27:48,759
Step back.

545
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:52,880
Search.

546
00:28:15,039 --> 00:28:15,839
What's this?

547
00:28:16,319 --> 00:28:16,839
A book.

548
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:17,720
What kind of book?

549
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:18,240
An ancient book.

550
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:19,599
Of course I know it's ancient.

551
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:21,079
It's a banned book.

552
00:28:21,079 --> 00:28:21,920
Don't you know?

553
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,039
Mao Shi Zheng Yi.

554
00:28:23,599 --> 00:28:24,759
A research work on the Classic of Poetry.

555
00:28:24,759 --> 00:28:25,680
Also known as Kong Shu.

556
00:28:25,799 --> 00:28:26,920
In the 16th year of the Zhenguan reign,

557
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:29,039
written by Kong Yingda by imperial decree.

558
00:28:29,039 --> 00:28:30,240
One of the Wu Jing Zheng Yi.

559
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:32,000
It was an officially issued book back then.

560
00:28:32,000 --> 00:28:33,039
All right, all right.

561
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:34,880
Page seven, line four.

562
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:37,000
What does it say? Read it out.

563
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:40,000
I thought you knew it all.

564
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,240
Sounding so smart.

565
00:28:41,240 --> 00:28:42,319
Can't remember it now?

566
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:44,039
Smuggling contraband.

567
00:28:45,039 --> 00:28:47,000
Seized for inspection. Confiscated.

568
00:28:47,799 --> 00:28:48,720
You can go.

569
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:54,920
Keep your new ID card safe.

570
00:29:01,640 --> 00:29:02,559
What are you shaking your head for?

571
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:04,799
Want us to search you again?

572
00:29:04,799 --> 00:29:05,880
We have a room over there.

573
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,000
I don't want the book anymore.

574
00:29:09,079 --> 00:29:10,000
That's what I thought.

575
00:29:16,680 --> 00:29:18,400
Stop pretending to be an intellectual.

576
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:23,960
What are you doing? Studying?

577
00:29:25,799 --> 00:29:27,000
The higher-ups want you to go back.

578
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:27,680
Before the end of your shift.

579
00:29:27,839 --> 00:29:28,599
Don't be late.

580
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:29,759
Go back for what?

581
00:29:29,759 --> 00:29:30,720
To give you a bonus.

582
00:29:31,440 --> 00:29:32,279
What do you think?

583
00:29:32,720 --> 00:29:34,839
Said they're handing out new houses and cars.

584
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:36,400
And a girl for you, too.

585
00:29:38,519 --> 00:29:40,319
Can't even get peace after work.

586
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:42,799
I have to monitor Liu Dengshi later.

587
00:29:43,039 --> 00:29:44,400
What the hell happened now?

588
00:29:44,960 --> 00:29:45,960
What else?

589
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:48,000
Getting new IDs and taking photos.

590
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:49,160
Getting a new lease on life.

591
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,200
I don't quite get it.

592
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:51,839
What exactly is Lee Teng-hui up to?

593
00:29:51,839 --> 00:29:52,799
Removing ancestral homes,

594
00:29:52,799 --> 00:29:53,839
replacing them with birthplaces.

595
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,960
From Ronghai/Zhangzhou to Taipei/Kaohsiung.

596
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:58,039
Will everyone vote for him then?

597
00:29:59,039 --> 00:29:59,759
You.

598
00:29:59,759 --> 00:30:01,160
Just call the higher-ups directly

599
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:02,160
and ask them.

600
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:09,559
Over a decade ago,

601
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:10,720
in the mainland,

602
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:12,839
those catching Taiwan, China broadcasts

603
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:14,079
would occasionally hear

604
00:30:14,079 --> 00:30:17,079
Taiwan, China's codes for sleeper agents.

605
00:30:17,079 --> 00:30:18,200
These coded messages

606
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:19,759
usually

607
00:30:19,759 --> 00:30:22,759
used four-character codes for orders.

608
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:25,240
Taiwan, China agents in the mainland

609
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:27,160
will continue to receive such codes.

610
00:30:27,319 --> 00:30:28,319
So listen up, everyone.

611
00:30:28,319 --> 00:30:31,319
Some of you, or perhaps one of you,

612
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:34,359
might spend decades of your lives

613
00:30:34,359 --> 00:30:35,920
trying to crack them.

614
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:43,160
Comrade 39533, please record.

615
00:30:43,599 --> 00:30:47,599
Comrade 39533, please record.

616
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:49,279
225.

617
00:30:49,279 --> 00:30:51,160
5963.

618
00:30:51,519 --> 00:30:52,920
Numbers are the keyhole.

619
00:30:53,359 --> 00:30:54,960
The codebook is the key.

620
00:30:55,119 --> 00:30:57,160
Only unlocking the message word by word

621
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,519
can it surface.

622
00:31:35,559 --> 00:31:36,279
Who are you?

623
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:44,920
Branches from the plant blocked the way.

624
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:46,279
I moved it.

625
00:31:46,279 --> 00:31:47,640
You didn't notice.

626
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:49,160
If you placed it there on purpose,

627
00:31:49,160 --> 00:31:51,480
to see if anyone had entered the room,

628
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:52,920
then today was pointless.

629
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:54,519
I left a very obvious mark

630
00:31:54,519 --> 00:31:56,519
on your door lock,

631
00:31:56,519 --> 00:31:57,880
and you didn't notice that either.

632
00:31:57,880 --> 00:31:59,599
That is just terrible.

633
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:01,359
Who exactly are you?

634
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:04,480
Military Intelligence, 4th Department.

635
00:32:04,480 --> 00:32:05,880
The new Deputy Director.

636
00:32:06,079 --> 00:32:07,279
Your direct superior.

637
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:09,799
Sir.

638
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,279
I've read your file.

639
00:32:14,559 --> 00:32:15,880
Your overall grades are average.

640
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:17,640
Your military skills are also average.

641
00:32:17,640 --> 00:32:19,920
But you're quite good with numbers.

642
00:32:19,920 --> 00:32:20,839
You know how to do business.

643
00:32:20,839 --> 00:32:23,480
You ran a clothing factory with your dad.

644
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:24,599
You're smart.

645
00:32:24,599 --> 00:32:27,640
You even ran a small business in the army.

646
00:32:30,079 --> 00:32:32,720
Why do you want to work in intelligence?

647
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:34,799
Reporting, sir.

648
00:32:34,799 --> 00:32:36,279
To fight to defend Taiwan, China.

649
00:32:37,319 --> 00:32:38,480
I was born in Taipei,

650
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:40,240
and when I die, I'll be buried in Taipei.

651
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:41,160
I enlisted

652
00:32:41,160 --> 00:32:42,480
for the sake of future peace.

653
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,799
Out of loyalty and conviction.

654
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:46,200
Try again.

655
00:32:52,079 --> 00:32:53,599
I can see right through those lies.

656
00:32:58,240 --> 00:32:59,799
What is your current assignment?

657
00:33:01,799 --> 00:33:04,200
On odd days, I inspect customs packages.

658
00:33:04,880 --> 00:33:05,759
On even days,

659
00:33:05,799 --> 00:33:07,000
I keep an eye on Liu Dengshi.

660
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:08,640
When greed goes too far,

661
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:09,240
it's called corruption.

662
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:10,160
When arrogance goes too far,

663
00:33:10,240 --> 00:33:11,160
it's called tyranny.

664
00:33:11,559 --> 00:33:13,480
That is our government's current state.

665
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:16,000
Those in power are a tumor, a cancer.

666
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:17,640
You watch me during the day,

667
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:19,000
and you watch me at night.

668
00:33:19,319 --> 00:33:20,200
Why don't you just arrest me?

669
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:21,000
It'd save us all the trouble.

670
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,200
He's that...

671
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:24,480
professor always bashing the government.

672
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:26,240
Doing such a boring job

673
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:27,720
for two whole years...

674
00:33:28,079 --> 00:33:29,680
Of course I'd be unhappy.

675
00:33:30,759 --> 00:33:32,039
If you had a choice,

676
00:33:32,279 --> 00:33:33,359
what would you want to do?

677
00:33:34,319 --> 00:33:35,119
Sir,

678
00:33:36,440 --> 00:33:38,000
many people from my class...

679
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,160
Some went to Japan,

680
00:33:40,680 --> 00:33:42,839
some went to Europe to study abroad.

681
00:33:43,039 --> 00:33:43,759
And some others

682
00:33:43,759 --> 00:33:44,640
went to the mainland.

683
00:33:44,640 --> 00:33:46,400
High budgets, fast promotions.

684
00:33:46,400 --> 00:33:49,519
I hear they're living it up every day.

685
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:51,279
I'm the only one stuck here.

686
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:53,240
I want to get out there, too.

687
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:08,079
Take a walk with me.

688
00:34:15,599 --> 00:34:16,280
Answer me.

689
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:18,559
What does "centrally dispatched" mean?

690
00:34:19,400 --> 00:34:20,280
Agents sent to the mainland.

691
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,679
Why use official personnel?

692
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:24,320
Enlist first, then train.

693
00:34:24,559 --> 00:34:26,719
Higher caliber and clearer minds.

694
00:34:26,719 --> 00:34:28,000
They know what the priorities are.

695
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:29,199
They know what to do.

696
00:34:29,719 --> 00:34:31,079
Once these people reach the mainland,

697
00:34:31,079 --> 00:34:33,400
the intel they gather isn't written down.

698
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:34,519
They won't leave any evidence.

699
00:34:35,119 --> 00:34:37,440
Everything is kept in their heads.

700
00:34:37,719 --> 00:34:39,480
No secret code needed for Taiwan, China.

701
00:34:39,719 --> 00:34:41,000
Once these people return,

702
00:34:41,559 --> 00:34:43,920
they can compile the intel they gathered.

703
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:44,920
It's secure communication.

704
00:34:45,559 --> 00:34:47,119
Look at Taipei down below.

705
00:34:47,760 --> 00:34:49,719
It's not as peaceful as it looks.

706
00:34:50,039 --> 00:34:52,280
Many CPC agents are right beside us.

707
00:34:52,639 --> 00:34:53,639
Think about it.

708
00:34:53,719 --> 00:34:55,039
Forty or fifty years ago,

709
00:34:55,039 --> 00:34:57,880
even Chiang had Communists by his side.

710
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:59,880
How do you know how many are left now?

711
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:03,039
Enemies are among us,

712
00:35:03,039 --> 00:35:04,320
and we are among them.

713
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:08,239
That's how intelligence work goes.

714
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:11,079
Our opponent has planted eyes around us,

715
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:14,679
and we have multiple ears on their side.

716
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:16,639
Your ancestral home is Ronghai.

717
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:19,519
Your grandfather speaks Zhangzhou dialect.

718
00:35:19,880 --> 00:35:21,400
You have a living great-aunt there.

719
00:35:22,079 --> 00:35:24,559
You possess many favorable qualifications.

720
00:35:25,159 --> 00:35:26,199
Comrade Lin Kanshan,

721
00:35:30,239 --> 00:35:31,159
to penetrate deep behind "enemy lines",

722
00:35:31,159 --> 00:35:32,239
you will depart soon.

723
00:35:33,079 --> 00:35:35,199
Pose as a businessman from Taiwan, China.

724
00:35:35,199 --> 00:35:36,719
Your codename is North Wind.

725
00:35:38,440 --> 00:35:39,039
Yes, sir.

726
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:40,639
Buy rice today,

727
00:35:40,639 --> 00:35:41,800
deliver flour tomorrow.

728
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:44,800
I'll send you messages via radio.

729
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:46,800
Do exactly as I say.

730
00:35:47,119 --> 00:35:48,480
Don't ask about what I haven't mentioned.

731
00:35:49,559 --> 00:35:51,480
Sometimes, the less you know,

732
00:35:51,480 --> 00:35:52,800
the safer you are.

733
00:35:53,599 --> 00:35:54,960
Perhaps,

734
00:35:55,119 --> 00:35:56,400
before long,

735
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:58,440
Lee Teng-hui will "visit the US".

736
00:35:58,440 --> 00:35:59,400
Just watch.

737
00:36:00,559 --> 00:36:02,199
The Taiwan Strait won't be peaceful.

738
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:03,440
Therefore,

739
00:36:04,719 --> 00:36:06,960
you must watch all mainland movements,

740
00:36:06,960 --> 00:36:09,280
from the military to the missiles.

741
00:36:10,719 --> 00:36:12,679
There might even be live-fire exercises.

742
00:36:12,679 --> 00:36:14,280
This is the most critical part.

743
00:36:14,719 --> 00:36:16,599
So the more intel you get,

744
00:36:16,599 --> 00:36:18,400
the lower the chances of war.

745
00:36:18,719 --> 00:36:20,199
The mainland has, in Taiwan, China,

746
00:36:20,199 --> 00:36:21,800
also planted and trained many people.

747
00:36:22,079 --> 00:36:24,320
Don't think they aren't watching you.

748
00:36:24,840 --> 00:36:26,039
Have a good drink today.

749
00:36:26,559 --> 00:36:27,639
When you wake up tomorrow,

750
00:36:27,639 --> 00:36:30,000
distance yourself from all your friends,

751
00:36:30,199 --> 00:36:32,400
and make everyone forget you.

752
00:36:34,119 --> 00:36:35,159
Hurry up and

753
00:36:35,719 --> 00:36:36,559
put on a new face.

754
00:36:37,199 --> 00:36:38,079
Go gamble.

755
00:36:38,320 --> 00:36:39,159
Go lose.

756
00:36:39,440 --> 00:36:41,039
Borrow all the money you can.

757
00:36:41,039 --> 00:36:42,639
Burden yourself with unpayable debts.

758
00:36:43,239 --> 00:36:43,760
Go get into fights.

759
00:36:44,039 --> 00:36:45,239
Go be a deadbeat.

760
00:36:45,559 --> 00:36:47,400
Make everyone avoid you,

761
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:49,599
to dispel all suspicions.

762
00:36:50,559 --> 00:36:51,679
You need to turn yourself

763
00:36:51,679 --> 00:36:53,960
into a desperate loser.

764
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:55,719
The more thorough of a loser you are,

765
00:36:56,239 --> 00:36:58,440
the safer you'll be on the mainland.

766
00:37:07,039 --> 00:37:07,679
Don't run!

767
00:37:08,159 --> 00:37:08,880
Don't run!

768
00:37:08,960 --> 00:37:09,679
Don't run!

769
00:37:09,760 --> 00:37:10,320
Freeze!

770
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,039
Don't run!

771
00:37:11,119 --> 00:37:11,840
Don't run!

772
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:17,280
Don't run!

773
00:37:21,639 --> 00:37:23,599
You're all skilled professionals.

774
00:37:24,280 --> 00:37:27,400
Ensure that even if you're fired,

775
00:37:28,039 --> 00:37:30,280
you can still find a new job out there.

776
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:33,280
Continue.

777
00:37:34,159 --> 00:37:35,559
When training to be a tour guide,

778
00:37:35,559 --> 00:37:37,360
you must actually go and get

779
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:38,280
your tour guide certificate.

780
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:40,039
Not only must you be familiar with

781
00:37:40,039 --> 00:37:41,800
all the attractions in Minzhong,

782
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:43,159
but also those in surrounding cities.

783
00:37:43,280 --> 00:37:44,400
Like Mount Wuyi,

784
00:37:44,400 --> 00:37:45,440
Gulangyu Island,

785
00:37:45,440 --> 00:37:46,800
Yongding Tulou,

786
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:48,360
and the Mazu Temple.

787
00:37:48,559 --> 00:37:49,840
No matter where you go,

788
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,960
you must be able to talk endlessly.

789
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:52,559
Understood?

790
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:53,559
Understood!

791
00:37:58,239 --> 00:37:59,679
Don't be shy. Come on.

792
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:09,920
You are a seed.

793
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:12,039
Planted there, you must survive first.

794
00:38:12,039 --> 00:38:14,599
Strive to grow into the tallest one.

795
00:38:15,039 --> 00:38:17,960
I'm surely not the only seed.

796
00:38:19,119 --> 00:38:20,280
Have any withered away?

797
00:38:20,280 --> 00:38:22,559
Crossing the street is risky too.

798
00:38:23,239 --> 00:38:25,159
You can catch a virus just breathing.

799
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:26,440
If you're that afraid,

800
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:28,480
you might as well just stay home.

801
00:38:28,480 --> 00:38:29,599
I'm not afraid.

802
00:38:29,599 --> 00:38:30,559
Gathering intelligence,

803
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:31,679
acting as a courier,

804
00:38:32,079 --> 00:38:33,000
I can do it all.

805
00:38:34,599 --> 00:38:35,800
These gentlemen here

806
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,000
are all big bosses.

807
00:38:37,159 --> 00:38:38,800
They all do business with the mainland.

808
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:40,239
They're all your seniors.

809
00:38:40,519 --> 00:38:41,880
This young friend of mine

810
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:44,159
also wants to open a factory on the mainland.

811
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:45,800
His family is in the textile business.

812
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:47,159
He's a young man with ambition.

813
00:38:47,199 --> 00:38:48,079
He wants to make money, of course.

814
00:38:48,079 --> 00:38:49,400
He wants to make his mark in the world.

815
00:38:49,480 --> 00:38:51,679
The mainland is reforming and opening up.

816
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:54,800
Communist money is still money.

817
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:57,480
I invited you all here

818
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:58,519
