819
00:38:58,519 --> 00:39:00,079
how to do business with mainlanders.

820
00:39:02,880 --> 00:39:03,679
Thank you, gentlemen.

821
00:39:04,079 --> 00:39:04,840
Thank you, bosses.

822
00:39:05,119 --> 00:39:05,880
Thank you, seniors.

823
00:39:07,039 --> 00:39:08,159
I look forward to your guidance.

824
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:18,280
Come on.

825
00:39:21,800 --> 00:39:24,440
Finish this drink.

826
00:39:28,159 --> 00:39:29,000
This...

827
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:53,159
Zhu, why bother?

828
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:56,320
You're a long-term asset.

829
00:39:56,320 --> 00:39:57,440
Find a way to scout

830
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:59,400
and recruit anyone we can use.

831
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:00,599
From the government, the military,

832
00:40:00,599 --> 00:40:02,239
the corporate, financial, or tech sectors.

833
00:40:02,239 --> 00:40:03,400
The more, the better.

834
00:40:05,599 --> 00:40:06,559
A toast to you, brothers.

835
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:21,320
Good, good, good.

836
00:40:22,800 --> 00:40:24,079
Lao Zhu.

837
00:40:24,079 --> 00:40:26,119
I'm definitely taking you under my wing.

838
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:28,800
Please look out for me, Brother Bin.

839
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,119
Come, come.

840
00:40:36,559 --> 00:40:38,079
You're not just doing this for yourself.

841
00:40:38,519 --> 00:40:40,440
Besides your future and mine,

842
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:42,159
there's also the future of Taiwan, China.

843
00:40:48,840 --> 00:40:50,519
It's all resting in your hands now.

844
00:40:51,559 --> 00:40:52,400
I'm willing to go.

845
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:54,760
Even if it means death.

846
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:55,679
Don't die.

847
00:40:56,719 --> 00:40:57,559
Stay alive.

848
00:40:58,000 --> 00:40:58,800
Remember,

849
00:40:59,719 --> 00:41:01,239
under no circumstances

850
00:41:01,239 --> 00:41:03,800
should you do anything "at all costs."

851
00:41:04,280 --> 00:41:05,320
Go there safe and sound,

852
00:41:07,159 --> 00:41:08,360
and come back safe and sound.

853
00:41:13,719 --> 00:41:15,599
Starting today, everyone,

854
00:41:16,519 --> 00:41:17,679
you need to come up with an alias.

855
00:41:17,679 --> 00:41:18,639
Pair up in twos.

856
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:19,800
Train in your groups.

857
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:20,719
Keep each other alert.

858
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:21,639
What should this alias be?

859
00:41:21,639 --> 00:41:23,239
It should be based on your

860
00:41:23,480 --> 00:41:24,679
real experiences,

861
00:41:24,679 --> 00:41:26,360
mixed with some fabricated ones.

862
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:28,079
Blend truth and lies together.

863
00:41:28,079 --> 00:41:29,239
From now on, at work

864
00:41:29,239 --> 00:41:31,239
and life, use each other's aliases.

865
00:41:31,400 --> 00:41:33,400
Think about it based on your situation.

866
00:41:38,239 --> 00:41:39,360
I want to partner with you.

867
00:41:39,840 --> 00:41:40,679
Are you willing?

868
00:41:42,199 --> 00:41:44,199
I thought you'd pick someone else.

869
00:41:44,199 --> 00:41:45,800
Although you're a bit slow to react,

870
00:41:45,880 --> 00:41:47,079
you're very detail-oriented.

871
00:41:47,239 --> 00:41:48,480
I think I'm pretty steady,

872
00:41:48,639 --> 00:41:50,239
but my mom says I'm impatient.

873
00:41:50,480 --> 00:41:51,519
We can complement each other.

874
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:53,079
Let me add one more thing.

875
00:41:53,079 --> 00:41:54,079
About the pairings,

876
00:41:54,079 --> 00:41:56,199
they must follow your trainee ID numbers.

877
00:41:56,400 --> 00:41:57,800
One with Two, Three with Four,

878
00:41:57,920 --> 00:41:59,280
Five with Six, and so on.

879
00:41:59,639 --> 00:42:00,960
Comrades who have decided on an alias

880
00:42:00,960 --> 00:42:02,519
can go find your partners.

881
00:42:03,159 --> 00:42:04,440
I'm 1973-

882
00:42:04,440 --> 00:42:06,239
02240013.

883
00:42:06,239 --> 00:42:06,840
How about you?

884
00:42:08,679 --> 00:42:09,679
I'm Number Five.

885
00:42:10,079 --> 00:42:11,079
You're Number Thirteen.

886
00:42:12,639 --> 00:42:13,440
Hello, Number Five.

887
00:42:13,719 --> 00:42:15,239
I'm Number Six, Huadong.

888
00:42:17,079 --> 00:42:17,639
Hello.

889
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:18,880
Jinlan.

890
00:42:27,719 --> 00:42:29,239
My name is He Chunxiao.

891
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:09,119
I am Wang Kai.

892
00:43:09,480 --> 00:43:10,840
Inviting you to watch the TV drama

893
00:43:11,119 --> 00:43:11,840
"Crossfire"

894
00:43:13,159 --> 00:43:14,840
From your first minute in this business,

895
00:43:14,840 --> 00:43:16,440
you should have known this day would come.

896
00:43:17,119 --> 00:43:18,119
Who told you to do this?

897
00:43:18,119 --> 00:43:19,239
This is against the rules.

898
00:43:19,320 --> 00:43:20,559
Here is a piece of Class-A intelligence.

899
00:43:20,800 --> 00:43:22,840
MIB wants me to activate someone.

900
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:24,119
Name, identity?

901
00:43:24,119 --> 00:43:26,559
He's left-handed and takes photos.

902
00:43:26,559 --> 00:43:27,480
Cover identity?

903
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:28,480
Probably a photographer.

904
00:43:28,480 --> 00:43:29,519
What are you here to do?

905
00:43:29,519 --> 00:43:30,599
It's International Investment Month.

906
00:43:30,920 --> 00:43:31,760
Making some investments.

907
00:43:32,440 --> 00:43:34,400
New trainees assigned to each division.

908
00:43:34,559 --> 00:43:35,599
The usual rules.

909
00:43:35,599 --> 00:43:36,199
Guide and mentor them.

910
00:43:36,199 --> 00:43:37,320
They're all promising recruits.
